.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
Provides a fluent builder for constructing complex \fBResult\fP objects across multiple processing steps, compiler stages, or mathematical operations\&. 

\fBResultBuilder\fP allows values, diagnostics, assertions, and exceptions to be accumulated progressively\&. It is designed for scenarios where the final output may contain multiple heterogeneous items or where the success state is determined by several independent operations\&. 

.PP
The builder never throws directly; instead, exceptions are captured inside the underlying \fBResult\fP instance\&. The caller may inspect or re-throw them using \fBResult\&.Throw\fP\&. 
